", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w3JiQl6Z2mcQ7kNvwEMSJs7&_nc_oc=Adoj_7RDH-oiRPUdlT1eMHHUcXGGO9L5bFfWgXBAn5SZPj7gZq1zuSownwj1F3RVzA4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0OYy4J4m4Hx660b7v42XWBO57HfGfcgKkuuIR4OE0Nbg&oe=69EA20F9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7W-EP5Z_A_8Q7kNvwHYHjdm&_nc_oc=AdrQHN6rXxeASxDKPPUFe3-P1_wZJyi-wjRqAc1pxV4Gnx-Zs-kWK0QLjb6gbYeSPMk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2sm6CXd_zKdeuju3gpBpZ_kqtBrBVaDpdc-Y1ri3aveQ&oe=69EA37CB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ExPr9kRxBhoQ7kNvwHOZSLE&_nc_oc=AdpcPB9P4Oa2Q8Lak_Q0j0jzBeUoeoKzU5ra-j3JK_xaDfgB68o4-DVdfTjxJT04qlY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2PTOxxdjy0y-KtCIXM3LLIy2d-VLszZvzak4dOUHs3Ww&oe=69EA364E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel